WEBVTT

00:23.900 --> 00:28.899
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.900 --> 00:35.419
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.420 --> 00:36.939
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.940 --> 00:38.749
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.750 --> 00:40.580
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.880 --> 01:01.849
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.850 --> 01:04.120
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.610 --> 01:09.780
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.360 --> 01:13.149
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.150 --> 01:16.019
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:16.020 --> 01:18.439
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.440 --> 01:21.189
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.190 --> 01:24.169
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.170 --> 01:26.959
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.960 --> 01:29.749
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.750 --> 01:32.499
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.500 --> 01:35.299
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.300 --> 01:38.520
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.080 --> 01:44.190
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.820 --> 01:56.859
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.860 --> 01:59.100
=Episode 6=
=A Thousand-Year Dream=

02:00.120 --> 02:01.280
Immortal Master.

02:01.320 --> 02:02.480
Save me.

02:03.160 --> 02:04.279
Zi Xuan.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.719
Who exactly is he?

02:05.720 --> 02:07.279
Everyone, do not be fooled by him.

02:07.280 --> 02:08.599
(Evil Sword Immortal)
He is not Clan Master Qing Wei.

02:08.600 --> 02:09.920
Insolent.

02:09.960 --> 02:11.479
Immortal Master, save me.

02:11.480 --> 02:13.119
I will help you kill them.

02:13.120 --> 02:15.039
The Clan Master Qing Wei I know

02:15.040 --> 02:17.800
would never commit
such a heaven defying act.

02:17.880 --> 02:20.719
Your appearance and spiritual power
are extremely similar to Qing Wei,

02:20.720 --> 02:25.040
yet they cannot conceal the evil
demonic aura emanating from you.

02:26.120 --> 02:27.080
Oh.

02:27.380 --> 02:29.119
A fake.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.659
That almost scared me to death.

02:30.660 --> 02:32.680
Fortunately,
he is not Changqing's master.

02:33.480 --> 02:34.790
So noisy.

02:37.800 --> 02:38.920
Be careful.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.640
Jing Tian.

02:46.080 --> 02:47.840
Jing Tian, are you all right?

02:54.900 --> 02:57.200
- So Zi Xuan is this powerful.
- So Zi Xuan is this powerful.

02:58.880 --> 03:00.600
So that is how it is.

03:00.840 --> 03:03.160
Such powerful spiritual energy.

03:20.120 --> 03:21.560
Who might you be?

03:22.000 --> 03:23.960
You are not worthy to know.

03:26.480 --> 03:28.080
He died just like that?

03:29.200 --> 03:30.480
He escaped.

03:31.120 --> 03:32.600
Thank you for stepping in to help.

03:38.360 --> 03:40.760
Why does this look a bit familiar?

03:40.840 --> 03:42.450
The current turmoil at Shu Mountain

03:42.690 --> 03:44.760
is very likely connected
to that evil demon just now.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.640
With your spiritual energy,

03:46.640 --> 03:48.760
if you had not shut yourself off
from sight and sound,

03:48.800 --> 03:50.799
how could you fail
to understand the cause and effect?

03:50.800 --> 03:51.600
I...

03:51.600 --> 03:53.219
You restrain
your spiritual power like this,

03:53.219 --> 03:54.879
are you not bringing
suffering upon yourself?

03:54.880 --> 03:57.400
This is my personal matter.
It does not concern you.

03:59.200 --> 04:00.600
Pawn the sword.

04:02.840 --> 04:04.160
You pawned the sword.

04:05.240 --> 04:06.319
May I ask, sir,

04:06.320 --> 04:07.799
are you here to redeem the pawn?

04:07.800 --> 04:09.910
The sword is yours.

04:12.000 --> 04:12.839
What?

04:12.840 --> 04:13.960
Truly?

04:14.360 --> 04:15.239
Thank you.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.330
Thank you, sir.

04:16.570 --> 04:17.400
Well then,

04:17.720 --> 04:18.919
please take care on your way.

04:18.920 --> 04:22.160
(So he was the one
who broke the Demon-Sealing Pagoda.)

04:22.560 --> 04:24.279
That guest was truly formidable.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.799
No idea which sect he belongs to.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.639
How should we ever
repay him in the future?

04:27.640 --> 04:29.599
That man looks so strange.

04:29.600 --> 04:30.960
Who is he?

04:31.160 --> 04:31.999
His name is Chong Lou.

04:32.000 --> 04:32.999
(Chong Lou?)

04:33.000 --> 04:34.560
(The Demon Lord.)

04:37.520 --> 04:38.679
This is bad.

04:38.680 --> 04:40.200
Luo Rulie got away again.

04:43.960 --> 04:44.920
Er Ya.

04:46.280 --> 04:48.040
Mother.

04:48.360 --> 04:50.200
Er Ya.

04:52.040 --> 04:54.159
Thank you you all.

04:54.160 --> 04:56.120
- Goodbye, brother and sister.
- Goodbye.

04:56.560 --> 04:57.360
Let us go.

05:00.840 --> 05:02.000
Zi Xuan.

05:02.300 --> 05:04.149
Are you still thinking
about what just happened?

05:04.150 --> 05:05.040
Yes.

05:05.120 --> 05:07.319
They used elixirs
to deceive people's hearts,

05:07.320 --> 05:11.080
and that evil demon could even
take the form of Qing Wei.

05:11.200 --> 05:12.599
Their ambition is no small matter.

05:12.600 --> 05:14.160
It will surely become a calamity.

05:14.360 --> 05:16.880
I fear it is closely tied to
the upheaval at Shu Mountain.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.479
I must go to Shu Mountain.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.720
To Shu Mountain?

05:19.760 --> 05:20.520
Yes.

05:20.550 --> 05:23.280
Then, does that mean we will
get to see the Shu Mountain swordsmen?

05:23.880 --> 05:25.039
Can you take us with you?

05:25.040 --> 05:26.640
Do you even need to ask?

05:26.810 --> 05:28.160
I want to go too.

05:30.060 --> 05:30.719
Me too.

05:30.720 --> 05:32.100
- All right.
- All right, let us go.

05:35.140 --> 05:39.260
(Anning Village)

05:50.400 --> 05:51.639
It is already late.

05:51.640 --> 05:53.120
Shu Mountain is steep.

05:53.240 --> 05:54.480
The paths are slippery.

05:54.640 --> 05:56.599
Let us find an inn and stay the night.

05:56.600 --> 05:58.079
We can head up the mountain tomorrow.

05:58.080 --> 05:59.120
All right.

06:00.240 --> 06:02.519
At last, no more dry rations.

06:02.520 --> 06:04.249
Let us order
something decent for dinner.

06:04.250 --> 06:05.890
Food is all you ever think about.

06:07.080 --> 06:09.719
At least we can finally
have a hot bath today.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.560
Let us go.

06:15.350 --> 06:17.250
What should we eat tonight?

06:28.020 --> 06:29.019
Hey, kid.

06:29.020 --> 06:30.000
Excuse me...

06:31.960 --> 06:33.080
Come home.

06:38.000 --> 06:39.399
This village

06:39.400 --> 06:40.880
feels strange.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.640
Is anyone here?

06:44.090 --> 06:45.560
Anyone?

06:46.280 --> 06:48.240
Is anyone here?

06:49.480 --> 06:50.319
Sir,

06:50.320 --> 06:51.679
is there an inn in the village?

06:51.680 --> 06:52.839
Do not come any closer.

06:52.840 --> 06:54.240
I am not afraid of you.

06:57.080 --> 06:59.080
Is there some kind of misunderstanding?

07:02.280 --> 07:03.999
Is this not the inn?

07:04.000 --> 07:04.710
Come on.

07:05.460 --> 07:06.939
We will stay here tonight.

07:06.940 --> 07:09.300
(Anxin Inn)

07:11.220 --> 07:12.869
(Anxin Inn)

07:12.870 --> 07:13.740
Careful.

07:15.240 --> 07:16.329
Look.

07:16.330 --> 07:18.290
Ah, this is...

07:22.160 --> 07:23.520
That was close.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.400
I will check it out.

07:34.430 --> 07:35.670
A ghost!

07:36.200 --> 07:37.720
You are a sword spirit.

07:37.800 --> 07:39.080
Why would you be afraid of this?

07:39.520 --> 07:40.640
That is true.

07:40.720 --> 07:43.599
What business brings you outsiders here?

07:43.600 --> 07:44.960
Enough of these tricks.

07:50.640 --> 07:53.440
Are you running a black inn?

07:53.840 --> 07:55.320
A ghost.

07:55.440 --> 07:56.720
Kui.

07:57.280 --> 07:58.239
Get up.

07:58.240 --> 07:59.520
Are you hurt?

07:59.640 --> 08:00.840
I am fine.

08:01.320 --> 08:02.560
Honored guests,

08:02.640 --> 08:04.159
what are you here for?

08:04.160 --> 08:04.799
This is an inn.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.520
We are here to stay the night.

08:07.000 --> 08:08.760
Four rooms, please.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.160
Staying the night?

08:11.160 --> 08:12.280
I am sorry.

08:12.360 --> 08:13.519
Please find another place.

08:13.520 --> 08:14.759
We are fully booked.

08:14.760 --> 08:17.599
There is clearly no one staying here.

08:17.600 --> 08:19.079
Why will you not let us stay?

08:19.080 --> 08:21.400
Another ghost!

08:21.680 --> 08:23.280
Innkeeper,

08:23.680 --> 08:25.920
we are all upright people.

08:26.170 --> 08:28.320
We are here to rid the world of demons.

08:28.800 --> 08:30.320
It is already late.

08:30.680 --> 08:32.120
We are traveling with women.

08:32.200 --> 08:33.320
In this area,

08:33.520 --> 08:35.360
yours is the only inn.

08:35.520 --> 08:36.800
Please grant us some convenience.

08:37.440 --> 08:38.560
Money.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.350
Where is my precious money pouch?

08:43.480 --> 08:44.409
The pouch?

08:44.410 --> 08:45.530
Where's my money?

08:45.610 --> 08:46.489
Where did my money go?

08:46.490 --> 08:47.690
Where is it?

08:47.810 --> 08:48.449
Not here.

08:48.450 --> 08:49.309
Not there either.

08:49.310 --> 08:50.729
This is going to cost me my life.

08:50.730 --> 08:52.060
Stop wailing.

08:52.250 --> 08:55.609
Back at the village entrance,
you were still patting your pouch like that.

08:55.610 --> 08:56.849
My precious money pouch.

08:56.850 --> 08:59.130
When you were calling it that...

08:59.570 --> 09:01.129
Is anyone there?

09:01.130 --> 09:03.649
I didn't see your pouch after that.

09:03.650 --> 09:05.209
I will search ahead.

09:05.210 --> 09:06.850
We will search nearby as well.

09:07.530 --> 09:09.170
Heavens.

09:10.050 --> 09:11.969
Ever since I can remember,

09:11.970 --> 09:14.629
every single coin
I saved by living frugally

09:14.630 --> 09:17.170
was kept in my precious money pouch.

09:17.530 --> 09:18.890
Stop shouting.

09:18.970 --> 09:20.689
It was clearly stolen.

09:20.690 --> 09:22.850
Everyone here has been robbed
so many times.

09:23.610 --> 09:25.330
Just look at my inn.

09:26.690 --> 09:28.410
It has been cleaned out.

09:29.850 --> 09:31.359
We guard it day and night,

09:31.360 --> 09:32.770
yet still cannot stop it.

09:32.780 --> 09:34.089
No matter what it is,

09:34.090 --> 09:36.369
even if it was right
in front of your eyes,

09:36.370 --> 09:37.490
it vanishes in an instant.

09:38.410 --> 09:41.730
That is why no one dares
leave anything out anymore.

09:43.370 --> 09:45.250
You have no money at all,

09:45.370 --> 09:46.399
so at my inn,

09:46.400 --> 09:47.989
you cannot stay.

09:47.990 --> 09:49.039
Unless

09:49.040 --> 09:50.890
you make do in the woodshed.

09:53.980 --> 09:56.440
This is no place for people to live.

09:59.210 --> 10:00.289
It is fine.

10:00.290 --> 10:02.679
I'll see if I can find a household
to ask for lodging.

10:02.680 --> 10:03.770
Excuse me...

10:04.810 --> 10:05.529
Sir,

10:05.530 --> 10:06.530
may we...

10:08.090 --> 10:09.470
Our money is gone,

10:09.810 --> 10:12.130
and the villagers have been
driven half mad by the thief.

10:13.170 --> 10:14.290
I fear

10:14.810 --> 10:17.359
there will be nowhere to stay tonight.

10:17.360 --> 10:18.350
Sorry to trouble you.

10:18.900 --> 10:20.329
My name is Wan Yuzhi.

10:20.330 --> 10:21.970
My home is just ahead.

10:22.170 --> 10:24.850
(Wan Yuzhi)
Are you looking for a place to stay the night?

10:25.570 --> 10:26.690
Yes.

10:27.090 --> 10:28.329
If you do not mind,

10:28.330 --> 10:29.970
I have a spare room at home.

10:31.050 --> 10:32.330
Come with me.

10:32.650 --> 10:33.209
Yes.

10:33.210 --> 10:33.889
That is wonderful.

10:33.890 --> 10:35.090
Thank you very much.

10:41.730 --> 10:43.250
This is my home.

10:44.160 --> 10:45.110
Please come in.

10:46.690 --> 10:48.689
Yuzhi's place is beautiful.

10:48.690 --> 10:50.460
There are flowers everywhere.

10:52.650 --> 10:54.130
These are the two rooms.

10:54.210 --> 10:55.730
Go and rest for now.

10:56.090 --> 10:58.289
I will prepare something for you to eat.

10:58.290 --> 10:58.969
Thank you.

10:58.970 --> 11:00.170
We really appreciate it.

11:00.250 --> 11:01.570
It is no trouble at all.

11:03.090 --> 11:04.369
Let us take a look inside.

11:04.370 --> 11:05.170
All right.

11:05.370 --> 11:08.250
She really is such a kind person.

11:16.690 --> 11:18.530
Only two rooms.

11:19.170 --> 11:20.410
How should we arrange this?

11:22.090 --> 11:23.250
What about Kui?

11:23.370 --> 11:24.689
You do not need to worry about me.

11:24.690 --> 11:25.649
Once night falls,

11:25.650 --> 11:27.810
I return to the sword to rest.

11:29.090 --> 11:30.689
I see now.

11:30.690 --> 11:32.050
That makes things easy.

11:32.490 --> 11:33.969
You stay in one room with Zi Xuan,

11:33.970 --> 11:35.090
and I will

11:35.330 --> 11:37.329
take the other room by myself.

11:37.330 --> 11:38.570
That works.

11:38.810 --> 11:40.009
It is a simple meal.

11:40.010 --> 11:42.090
Please make do
and have something to eat.

11:43.010 --> 11:44.009
These rice cakes

11:44.010 --> 11:45.170
look beautiful.

11:47.850 --> 11:49.049
They are soft and sweet,

11:49.050 --> 11:50.209
with a delicate floral scent.

11:50.210 --> 11:52.050
They are nothing
like ordinary rice cakes.

11:53.090 --> 11:54.890
I made them myself.

11:55.170 --> 11:58.130
I added azalea petals from the valley.

11:59.020 --> 12:00.170
Please help yourselves.

12:00.330 --> 12:01.889
My husband is confined to bed,

12:01.890 --> 12:03.370
so I need to look after him.

12:21.850 --> 12:22.970
Tian.

12:23.530 --> 12:26.250
There is a strong demonic presence
filling this valley.

12:26.330 --> 12:27.729
Be extra cautious tonight.

12:27.730 --> 12:28.479
All right.

12:28.480 --> 12:29.449
I understand, Zi Xuan.

12:29.450 --> 12:31.249
Mm. I will head back to my room.

12:31.250 --> 12:33.570
Then I will skip eating as well.
I am going back to my room.

12:34.530 --> 12:36.330
Zi Xuan, wait for me.

12:42.770 --> 12:44.329
Traveling all day is exhausting.

12:44.330 --> 12:45.890
I should get some sleep.

12:57.790 --> 13:00.270
(Demon Sword Realm)

13:01.170 --> 13:02.290
Tian.

13:05.730 --> 13:07.170
How did you get in here?

13:07.250 --> 13:08.529
Where is this?

13:08.530 --> 13:10.530
Inside the Demon Sword.

13:10.570 --> 13:13.090
Inside the Demon Sword?

13:19.370 --> 13:20.810
Why did you suddenly hit me?

13:22.770 --> 13:24.010
Enough talking.

13:28.250 --> 13:29.730
You are serious?

13:35.530 --> 13:38.089
This is the move
you used to defeat Luo Rulie.

13:38.090 --> 13:39.170
Draw your sword.

13:40.150 --> 13:41.369
The Demon Sword is in your hand.

13:41.370 --> 13:42.480
What am I supposed to draw?

13:42.480 --> 13:43.089
Tian,

13:43.090 --> 13:44.609
you and the Demon Sword are of one mind.

13:44.610 --> 13:46.450
Just call to it in your heart.

14:40.150 --> 14:41.350
(Soul-Shocking Thunder,
Roaring Blade Gale)

14:49.960 --> 14:50.559
Kui.

14:50.560 --> 14:51.720
Are you all right?

14:51.820 --> 14:52.759
That is a relief. Tian.

14:52.760 --> 14:53.959
You have learned it.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.080
I…

14:55.280 --> 14:57.079
I actually pulled it off myself.

14:57.080 --> 14:58.200
That is right.

14:58.480 --> 15:01.599
This proves that you have
the ability to wield the Demon Sword.

15:01.600 --> 15:04.119
And the only one in the world
who can wield it

15:04.120 --> 15:07.160
is Long Yang,
Crown Prince of the Jiang Kingdom.

15:09.030 --> 15:10.420
Jiang Kingdom.

15:11.540 --> 15:12.960
Long Yang.

15:15.520 --> 15:17.919
This place feels
both familiar and unfamiliar.

15:17.920 --> 15:19.680
What happened in the past

15:19.720 --> 15:21.199
was too painful.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.840
If you do not remember,

15:22.900 --> 15:24.740
perhaps that is for the best.

15:26.080 --> 15:27.239
You keep calling him,

15:27.240 --> 15:28.630
yet you refuse to explain anything.

15:29.000 --> 15:30.880
No wonder he is completely confused.

15:31.400 --> 15:32.759
He should know,

15:32.760 --> 15:33.920
should he not?

15:34.720 --> 15:35.759
Yes.

15:35.760 --> 15:36.960
Go on.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.800
A thousand years ago,

15:40.040 --> 15:42.000
this was our home.

15:42.280 --> 15:45.199
♪Jade pendants entwine,
heaven and earth cry out♪

15:45.200 --> 15:48.239
Back then, you were Long Yang,
Crown Prince of the Jiang Kingdom.

15:48.240 --> 15:51.399
♪A heart adrift like duckweed,
a body light as drifting catkins♪

15:51.400 --> 15:53.200
And I was your younger sister,

15:53.240 --> 15:54.720
Princess Long Kui.

15:55.600 --> 15:57.480
- The enemy is at the gates.
- Kill.

15:57.880 --> 16:00.339
From a royal scroll
passed down through generations,

16:00.340 --> 16:02.280
you discovered the method
to forge the Demon Sword.

16:02.320 --> 16:04.960
You hoped to create it
to counter a powerful foe.

16:05.280 --> 16:06.959
But before the sword was completed,

16:06.960 --> 16:08.680
the enemy had already broken in.

16:09.200 --> 16:10.439
At that moment,

16:10.440 --> 16:12.480
I leapt into the sword forge and died.

16:13.640 --> 16:15.119
That was not all.

16:15.120 --> 16:17.520
The invaders even threw the bodies
of the people of Jiang Kingdom

16:17.560 --> 16:20.000
into the forge, burning them for sport.

16:20.560 --> 16:21.760
No one expected

16:22.160 --> 16:24.000
that such overwhelming resentment

16:24.120 --> 16:26.280
would finally give birth
to the Demon Sword.

16:26.530 --> 16:29.999
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

16:30.000 --> 16:33.579
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

16:33.580 --> 16:36.889
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

16:36.890 --> 16:40.749
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

16:40.750 --> 16:42.959
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

16:42.960 --> 16:45.919
The power of the Demon Sword
devastated our kingdom,

16:45.920 --> 16:47.400
as well as the enemy's land.

16:47.920 --> 16:49.240
For hundreds of miles,

16:49.720 --> 16:51.880
everything was reduced to ruins.

16:52.400 --> 16:53.680
This later became known as

16:54.560 --> 16:56.480
the Heavenly Sword Catastrophe.

16:57.280 --> 16:58.460
From then on,

16:58.600 --> 17:01.280
my spirit became bound
to the Demon Sword.

17:01.440 --> 17:02.720
For a thousand years,

17:02.760 --> 17:05.480
I was never able to find you.

17:05.560 --> 17:06.840
Instead, I kept

17:06.960 --> 17:09.080
falling into one danger after another.

17:09.120 --> 17:10.760
She was too weak,

17:10.880 --> 17:12.560
and did not know how to protect herself.

17:12.680 --> 17:16.160
Fortunately, that instinct
to protect allowed me to emerge.

17:16.560 --> 17:17.559
Otherwise,

17:17.560 --> 17:19.960
how could we have
survived these centuries?

17:21.480 --> 17:22.599
Now,

17:22.600 --> 17:24.760
I have finally found you, Brother.

17:28.880 --> 17:30.680
You have both suffered greatly.

17:31.040 --> 17:33.880
But I am no longer Long Yang.

17:34.120 --> 17:34.999
My name is Jing Tian.

17:35.000 --> 17:36.520
I work at Yong'an Pawnshop.

17:36.760 --> 17:37.880
That said,

17:38.400 --> 17:40.560
whether I am Jing Tian or Long Yang,

17:40.720 --> 17:42.440
I will protect you both.

17:43.080 --> 17:44.079
That is wonderful.

17:44.080 --> 17:45.840
Brother finally back.

17:47.380 --> 17:50.599
You only know a few of the five elemental
Demon Sword techniques,

17:50.600 --> 17:52.160
yet you talk about protecting us.

17:52.520 --> 17:54.120
Demon Sword techniques?

17:54.200 --> 17:55.720
Five elements?

17:56.220 --> 17:58.800
Can you teach me a few more moves?
I will study them seriously.

17:59.760 --> 18:00.880
You want to learn?

18:06.400 --> 18:07.519
Boy,

18:07.520 --> 18:08.720
watch closely.

18:10.520 --> 18:13.920
Between heaven and earth exist wind,
thunder, water, fire, and earth,

18:13.920 --> 18:15.520
five forms of natural spiritual force.

18:15.520 --> 18:17.240
They generate and restrain one another.

18:17.320 --> 18:19.519
Water restrains fire.
Fire restrains earth.

18:19.520 --> 18:20.640
Thunder restrains water.

18:20.720 --> 18:21.769
Wind restrains thunder.

18:21.770 --> 18:23.130
Earth restrains wind.

18:23.600 --> 18:25.160
Each linked in turn,

18:26.650 --> 18:28.570
endless and unbroken.

18:58.170 --> 18:59.129
Again.

18:59.130 --> 19:00.250
Jing Tian.

19:01.410 --> 19:02.530
Jing Tian.

19:02.600 --> 19:03.500
Jing Tian.

19:07.330 --> 19:08.450
Xuejian.

19:09.050 --> 19:10.370
Why are you here?

19:11.170 --> 19:12.730
You are asking me?

19:13.390 --> 19:15.490
You suddenly started shouting
in the middle of the night,

19:15.490 --> 19:17.050
I thought something had happened.

19:18.450 --> 19:20.970
That was not a dream just now, was it?

19:21.410 --> 19:22.530
What was that sound?

19:24.530 --> 19:25.089
Could it be

19:25.090 --> 19:26.649
what Zi Xuan said,

19:26.650 --> 19:27.970
that the demon is here?

19:37.210 --> 19:39.570
What kind of demonic art is this?

19:48.480 --> 19:49.759
Unite sword and qi,

19:49.760 --> 19:51.240
ride the sword and soar.

19:51.480 --> 19:52.400
Rise.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.160
It worked.

19:56.160 --> 19:57.320
Jing Tian.

20:18.520 --> 20:21.799
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

20:21.800 --> 20:25.119
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

20:25.120 --> 20:28.799
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

20:28.800 --> 20:31.999
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

20:32.000 --> 20:35.159
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

20:35.160 --> 20:38.839
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

20:38.840 --> 20:42.559
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

20:42.560 --> 20:49.039
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

20:49.040 --> 20:52.519
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

20:52.520 --> 20:55.999
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

20:56.000 --> 20:59.399
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

20:59.400 --> 21:02.799
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

21:02.800 --> 21:06.159
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:06.160 --> 21:09.679
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

21:09.680 --> 21:13.039
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

21:13.040 --> 21:16.359
♪All for the sake of the living♪

21:16.360 --> 21:21.160
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

21:36.870 --> 21:39.000
(Next episode preview)
I have no grievance with either of you,

21:39.000 --> 21:41.009
yet you keep pressing me
again and again.

21:41.010 --> 21:42.370
Since that is the case,

21:42.530 --> 21:44.890
do not blame me for showing no mercy.

21:45.250 --> 21:46.250
Xuejian!

21:52.810 --> 21:55.730
This... This is
the little monkey from earlier.
